# Italian translation of OxyDDT.
#
# The vocabulary is the one a warehouse and an accountant already use — causale,
# vettore, porto, colli, aspetto esteriore dei beni — rather than a literal
# rendering of the English. On an Italian delivery note those words are the
# names of boxes on a form somebody has filled in by hand for thirty years.
#
